You are a senior Flutter engineer.

Create a production-ready Flutter project with a centralized design system.
Follow Material 3. Do not use inline styles. Everything must come from theme files.

PROJECT RULES

- Flutter stable
- Material 3
- Clean architecture
- One global theme
- No Colors.blue or inline Color/TextStyle
- Mobile + Web compatible

FOLDER STRUCTURE
lib/
core/
theme/
app_colors.dart
app_typography.dart
app_theme.dart
main.dart
app.dart

FONTS

- Use Inter font
- Configure in pubspec.yaml
- Use Inter for all text

CREATE app_colors.dart WITH THESE TOKENS

Background: #F8FAFC
Foreground: #111827
Border: #E5E7EB
Input: #FFFFFF

Primary: #2563EB
Primary Foreground: #FFFFFF

Secondary: #F1F5F9
Secondary Foreground: #0F172A

Muted: #F1F5F9
Muted Foreground: #6B7280

Accent: #DBEAFE
Accent Foreground: #1E3A8A

Success: #16A34A
Success Foreground: #FFFFFF

Warning: #F59E0B
Warning Foreground: #78350F

Destructive: #DC2626
Destructive Foreground: #FFFFFF

Card: #FFFFFF
Card Foreground: #111827

Sidebar: #020617
Sidebar Foreground: #E5E7EB
Sidebar Primary: #2563EB
Sidebar Primary FG: #FFFFFF

CREATE app_typography.dart

- Font family: Inter
- headline: 22px, semi-bold
- title: 16px, medium
- body: 14px, regular
- label: 13px, medium
- button: 14px, semi-bold
- All colors must come from AppColors

CREATE app_theme.dart

- Enable Material 3
- Map all colors to ColorScheme
- Scaffold background = Background
- Card theme with border radius 12 and border color
- InputDecorationTheme:
  - Filled
  - Border radius 10
  - Default border = Border
  - Focus border = Primary
  - Error border = Destructive
- ElevatedButtonTheme:
  - Height 48
  - Full width
  - Background = Primary
  - Text style = button typography
- Use Inter font globally

main.dart

- Initialize app
- Use AppTheme.lightTheme
- Disable debug banner

IMPORTANT

- Do not add demo UI
- Do not add extra colors
- Do not add inline styling
- Everything must be reusable and scalable
